Speech-to-text and speaker recognition models are not included in this
repository. Each model Oread uses carries its own license, listed in the
README. The default speech-to-text model is Moonshine base by Useful
Sensors (MIT License); NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2 (CC BY 4.0) is offered
as an option. The default voiceprint model is NVIDIA TitaNet Small, covered
by the NeMo toolkit license (Apache License 2.0).

The Explore page bundles jQuery 3.7.1 and jQuery UI 1.13.3 (copyright OpenJS
Foundation and other contributors) and PivotTable.js 2.23.0 (copyright 2012
Nicolas Kruchten, Datacratic, other contributors), each under the MIT License;
their license texts are in oread/web/vendor/LICENSES.md.

The test clips in tests/audio/ (librispeech-0, -1 and -2) and the sample
household's clips in sample/clips/ (read by LibriSpeech speakers 4446, 61 and
1580; see sample/sample.yaml) come from the LibriSpeech corpus (Panayotov et al.,
https://www.openslr.org/12), licensed under CC BY 4.0. They are unchanged apart
from conversion from FLAC to WAV.
